1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:05,110
This is where it all pays off.

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:07,800
All the work, all the sacrifices.

3
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,220
It ends here.

4
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:12,280
And we couldn't have done it
without you, Fisher.

5
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:14,010
Don't thank me yet.

6
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,590
Damnation.
What's going on?

7
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:28,060
It seems Mr. Sykes was right.

8
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:31,520
Our Mr. Fisher is a traitor and a spy.

9
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:34,040
And for that, he dies.

10
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,900
Kill Fisher on sight!
